BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Latin Blues Funk
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260806T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260807T003000
UID:89d30884dcf5df6ca6b923aa75fd1234@madamsorgan.com
DESCRIPTION:LBF is a Washington D.C. band which specializes in Latin\, Blu
 es and Funk music. Members of LBF have appeared with groups such as the Oh
 io Players\, George Duke\, El Gran Combo\, Willie Colon\, Horace Silver\, 
 Ray Barretto\, and Young and Rollins. They have also played with local sal
 sa bands such as Peligro\, Tentacion\, Sin Miedo\, Alfredo Mojica and Frie
 nds\, and Tumbao. https://www.latinbluesfunk.com/
LOCATION:Madam's Organ Blues Bar\, 2461 18th Street NW\, Washington\, DC 2
 0009
URL:https://madamsorgan.com/events/latin-blues-funk-2/
X-SOURCE:Madam's Organ
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Bluebyrdes
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260807T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260808T010000
UID:1901d951df927182a14125b16c5f69f2@madamsorgan.com
DESCRIPTION:Founded in 2020 out of Anaheim Hills\, The Blue Byrdes pull fr
 om the well that classic rock dug deep – the Allman Brothers\, Stevie Ra
 y Vaughan\, Eric Clapton\, Jimi Hendrix – and run it through a younger s
 et of hands. Soulful melody\, loud honest playing\, arrangements that brea
 the. They are not reviving the old sound so much as refusing to let it sit
  still. ​ Cut from The Allman Brothers Stevie Ray Vaughan Eric Clapton J
 imi Hendrix
LOCATION:Madam's Organ Blues Bar\, 2461 18th Street NW\, Washington\, DC 2
 0009
URL:https://madamsorgan.com/events/the-bluebyrdes/
X-SOURCE:Madam's Organ
END:VEVENT
